{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05060","headline":"洛州萧司兵谒兄还赴洛成礼 · 沈佺期","name":"洛州萧司兵谒兄还赴洛成礼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"棠棣日光辉，高襟应序归。\n来成鸿雁聚，去作凤皇飞。\n细草乘轻传，惊花惨别衣。\n灞亭春有酒，岐路惜芬菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}